Recommends: gnome-control-center
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for VLESS (Xray)
 Adds VLESS connections to NetworkManager. Servers appear in GNOME Settings
 and in the Quick Settings menu like any other VPN and can be controlled with
 nmcli.
 .
 Supports TCP (with XTLS Vision), XHTTP, WebSocket, HTTPUpgrade and gRPC with
 TLS or REALITY, a full tunnel for IPv4 and IPv6, import of vless:// links and
 automatically updated subscriptions.
 .
 The package includes a verified build of Xray-core, which runs as an
 unprivileged user.
